[?2004l| 5 | Block & Quarantine Covert DNS Tunnel | `/etc/pgdaemon.conf` | OPEN | **ADDED (SILENT C2):** Missed by initial shift. Block resolver domain `update-postgres.example.cn` `` `/disk/etc/pgdaemon.conf:3` ``, quarantine `/etc/pgdaemon.conf`, and terminate associated process. |
| 6 | Quarantine Dropper & Mining Binary | `/var/lib/pgsql/.local/pgdaemon` | OPEN | **ADDED (MALWARE DROPPER):** Quarantine `/var/lib/pgsql/.local/pgdaemon` `` `/disk/var/lib/pgsql/.local/pgdaemon:1` `` (ALERT-01 `` `/sas/alerts.json:3` ``) and clean `/tmp` stagers. |

