[?2004l[?2004h> #### Step 2.2: Quarantine Malicious Cron Job (`/var/spool/cron/postgres`)
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Objective:** Eliminate periodic re-infection beaconing.
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Commands:**
[?2004l[?2004h>   ```bash
[?2004l[?2004h>   mkdir -p /var/quarantine/cron
[?2004l[?2004h>   cp /var/spool/cron/postgres /var/quarantine/cron/postgres.bak
